       Q: You said 'keep fatigue low', but the hard constraint allows fatigue up to 0.4 (40th percentile of the normalised scale). Should the optimiser actively minimise fatigue below 0.4, or is staying at or below 0.4 sufficient, freeing the remaining optimisation budget entirely for value_efficiency?
