    4. value_efficiency — resource aggregation method
       Q: Value_efficiency divides delivered product value by 'total resource consumption', but four resource types are listed (energy, raw materials, labour hours, machine time). Should these be summed in monetary terms, normalised to a common unit, or tracked as separate denominators? The choice determines which resource substitutions the optimiser will favour.
