  [Escalation] Remediation options presented to manager:
    - Option 1 — Add a Third Shift and Redistribute Workload (Preferred): Introduce a third production shift to distribute the 25% demand increase across more worker-hours. Pair with job rotation every 90 minutes to cap individual fatigue accumulation, and install temporary acoustic baffles around the highest-noise workstations. Estimated effort: 2–3 days to onboard and schedule new shift. This option fully preserves both the FatigueIndex and Noise constraints with no relaxation required, at the cost of additional labor spend and a short ramp-up delay.
